(* Pia.Image.Gif.Spec and Pia.Image.Gif.Lzw (ADR 0054, step 2): every goal
   of the LZW dictionary's spec and of the decoder is proved, with nothing
   accepted unproved: the decoder's reads and writes are in bounds, its
   loops end, each code's string is the spec's, and the table stays well
   formed.
// RUN: piac --verify %S/../../lib/Pia/Image/Gif/Spec.pia | FileCheck --check-prefix=SPEC %s
